# Not written:
#   antispoof em1 network: 'em1 network' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   antispoof em1 address: 'em1 address' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   brute force: 'bruteforce' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   line 49: 'spamd' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   admin ssh: 'em2 network' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   line 91: 'egress address' holds members whose addresses are not known
#   line 86: no IPv4 address as the source
#   line 85: host names as the destination: Cato takes them as destinations on the internet only
#   line 84: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   line 66: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
#   line 65: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
